@tracymckibben @derekoharrow These warnings won't go away until both of the bullet points are addressed in the [above comment](https://github.com/home-assistant/core/issues/87335#issuecomment-1426847663).  

There is an open PR that addresses the first bullet point: https://github.com/home-assistant/core/pull/87957 I haven't had time to work on the 2nd bullet point yet.  I don't have any ETA as I don't know when I"ll have time to work on that.  It can also take quite a bit of time to get things reviewed after the work is done, so I wouldn't expect it to be released for a few months.

Generally speaking the issue will be closed when the fix is merged and ready for a future release, so if you still see it in an open status than it hasn't yet been resolved.
